 DECISIONS
 ---------
2026-07-30 04:42:00 — [INFO] Author chose: both sources coexist
2026-07-30 04:42:30 — [INFO] Rationale — no public API returns retroactive follower
                             counts, so a real source cannot demonstrate trend
                             detection today. Removing the simulation would mean
                             the project's main feature shows "insufficient data"
                             for days. Keeping both gives real data AND a
                             demonstrable feature, without pretending either is
                             something it is not.
2026-07-30 04:43:00 — [INFO] Rejected: backfilling real history with estimates.
                             Presenting invented past figures next to measured ones
                             is exactly what invalidates an analysis.
2026-07-30 04:43:30 — [INFO] Spotify stays terminal-only: a client secret cannot
                             live in a page anyone can read

